Generic in the budget / letter wherever the definitions are: the codec row
(`2B-3` / `3B-3+dc` / swapped), the repaired `B+1` orientation, moved ticks
and moved walks (= record ticks / walks on any duplicate-free map), and the
first-row pack / unpack of the phase context.  The table enters only through
`StairPhysicalLayout.budgets` and its six concrete codec constants.
