The record's multiplication rest `restXXN` and the hosted rest
`hostedExitRest` are both point-writes of the record rest `restXX` on every
state reached after `squareEntry` (`rest_pw` and `hosted_rest_pw`).  With the
entry-stage equality of `StairCallerEntry` this gives a run equality between
the hosted generic program and the record's `FlagExit.genericN`, with an
explicitly constructed record tape.
